@fhirServer = http://localhost:8080

### Validate PSI, method, star modifier, and caries risk
POST {{fhirServer}}/fhir/Observation/$validate?profile=https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/StructureDefinition/prophylaxis-observation
Authorization: {{$processEnv AIDBOX_AUTH}}
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

< ../../fsh-generated/resources/Observation-ExampleProphylaxisObservation.json

### Validate unavailable sextant through dataAbsentReason
POST {{fhirServer}}/fhir/Observation/$validate?profile=https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/StructureDefinition/prophylaxis-observation
Authorization: {{$processEnv AIDBOX_AUTH}}
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

< ../../fsh-generated/resources/Observation-ExampleProphylaxisObservationUnavailableSextant.json

### Validate that reordered PSI components retain explicit sextant identity
POST {{fhirServer}}/fhir/Observation/$validate?profile=https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/StructureDefinition/prophylaxis-observation
Authorization: {{$processEnv AIDBOX_AUTH}}
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

< ../../fsh-generated/resources/Observation-ExampleProphylaxisObservationReordered.json

### Reject an unknown caries-risk code
POST {{fhirServer}}/fhir/Observation/$validate?profile=https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/StructureDefinition/prophylaxis-observation
Authorization: {{$processEnv AIDBOX_AUTH}}
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

